{"id":"ausrede","lemma":"Ausrede","pos":"noun","rank":3207,"glosses":["excuse"],"ipa":"/ˈaʊ̯sˌʁeːdə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/99/De-Ausrede.ogg/De-Ausrede.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Ausrede","plural":"Ausreden"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich brauche keine Ausrede.","en":"I don't need an excuse.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Ich hoffe, du hast eine gute Ausrede.","en":"I hope you have a good excuse.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"hoffen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Das ist doch bloß eine Ausrede.","en":"That's just an excuse.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"but / yes"},{"g":"merely, only"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Er dachte sich eine Ausrede aus.","en":"He thought up an excuse.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"So eine Ausrede kann ich nicht annehmen.","en":"I can't accept an excuse like that.","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to assume, to suppose"}]}]}